1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,341
You bite one chilli

2
00:00:01,341 --> 00:00:02,490
and your whole mouth

3
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:04,467
is on FIRE!

4
00:00:04,516 --> 00:00:05,900
Nothing is burning.

5
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:06,555
That chilli

6
00:00:06,555 --> 00:00:07,083
just pulled

7
00:00:07,083 --> 00:00:08,333
your fire alarm.

8
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,814
Your tongue has sensors

9
00:00:09,814 --> 00:00:11,330
for real heat...

10
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:12,867
like scalding soup.

11
00:00:12,897 --> 00:00:14,390
A chilli molecule

12
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:15,700
fits them...

13
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:16,967
like a key.

14
00:00:16,995 --> 00:00:17,779
So your brain

15
00:00:17,779 --> 00:00:19,278
hears FIRE...

16
00:00:19,278 --> 00:00:20,067
and turns on the

17
00:00:20,109 --> 00:00:21,336
sprinklers.

18
00:00:21,336 --> 00:00:22,880
Subscribe...

19
00:00:22,891 --> 00:00:24,367
the chilli meant it.

20
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:25,650
Birds can't feel it.

21
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,454
Scientists think

22
00:00:26,454 --> 00:00:27,981
the plant aims it...

23
00:00:27,981 --> 00:00:29,533
at mammals.

24
00:00:29,578 --> 00:00:31,033
And you...

25
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,633
ordered extra.

